<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<%- include('./../common/header') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />

<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0d0a0c] text-white antialiased" style="font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, sans-serif;">

  <div class="w-full max-w-[480px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <%- include('./../common/common') %>

    <!-- ================= 히어로 ================= -->
    <section class="w-full pt-28 pb-20 px-8 text-center relative">
      <span class="absolute top-20 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-12 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-rose-400/40 to-transparent"></span>
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.45em] uppercase text-rose-300/50 mb-8" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">인연 · 연애 · 궁합</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white mb-5" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">
        당신의 연애운을<br>읽어드립니다
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-zinc-500 max-w-[340px] mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        타입, 인연의 시기, 궁합까지.<br>연애에 집중한 운세.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 세로로 큰 이미지 카드 ================= -->
    <section class="w-full px-4 pb-10 flex flex-col gap-8">
      <!-- 연애사주 -->
      <a href="/saju/romantic/intro" class="block w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-zinc-800/30 border border-white/[0.08] relative group shadow-xl shadow-black/20">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] min-h-[280px] relative">
          <img src="/assets/images/tight/main/slot1.png" alt="연애사주" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.classList.remove('hidden');">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-800/80">
            <span class="text-sm">이미지 영역</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-200 text-xs font-medium border border-rose-400/20">연애운</span>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-left">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-white block drop-shadow-md" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">연애사주</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">나의 타입 · 인연의 시기</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">진짜 나와 맞는 타입, 좋아질 때가 언제인지 사주로 읽어드려요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>


      <!-- 29금 사주 -->
      <a href="/saju/adult/intro" class="block w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-zinc-800/30 border border-white/[0.08] relative group shadow-xl shadow-black/20">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] min-h-[280px] relative">
          <img src="/assets/images/tight/main/slot2.png" alt="29금 사주" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.classList.remove('hidden');">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-800/80">
            <span class="text-sm">이미지 영역</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-600/25 text-rose-200 text-xs font-medium border border-rose-500/25">19+</span>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-left">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-white block drop-shadow-md" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">29금 사주</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">깊은 연애 · 끌림 · 관계</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">끌림, 관계, 솔직한 연애 성향까지. 한 단계 더 깊은 운세.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <!-- 재회사주 -->
      <a href="/saju/reunion/intro" class="block w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-zinc-800/30 border border-white/[0.08] relative group shadow-xl shadow-black/20">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] min-h-[280px] relative">
          <img src="/assets/images/tight/main/slot3.png" alt="재회사주" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.classList.remove('hidden');">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-800/80">
            <span class="text-sm">이미지 영역</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-violet-500/20 text-violet-200 text-xs font-medium border border-violet-400/20">재회운</span>
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-left">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium text-white block drop-shadow-md" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">재회사주</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">끊어진 인연 · 다시 이어질 수 있을까</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed">재회 가능 시기와 상대의 마음을 사주로 읽어드려요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 유용한 메뉴 (결과 다시보기, 티켓) ================= -->
    <section class="w-full px-4 pb-12">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-white/90 mb-4 px-1" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">바로가기</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/saju/review" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.08] p-4 hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-rose-500/20 transition-all">
          <span class="text-rose-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-white">결과 다시보기</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500">유료 운세 결과 확인</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/saju/ticket" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.08] p-4 hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-rose-500/20 transition-all">
          <span class="text-rose-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 5v2m0 4v2m0 4v2M5 5a2 2 0 00-2 2v3a2 2 0 110 4v3a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-3a2 2 0 110-4V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-white">티켓</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500">이용권 확인 · 등록</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 이용 후기 ================= -->
    <section class="w-full px-4 pb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 px-1">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-white/90" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;">이용 후기</h2>
        <a href="/saju/reviews" class="text-sm text-rose-300/90 hover:text-rose-300">더 보기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400/90 text-xs">★★★★★</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">연애사주</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">연애사주에서 나랑 잘 맞는 타입이 뭔지, 언제 인연이 올지 나와 있어서 좋았어요. 궁합도 말한 대로라서 놀랐어요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400/90 text-xs">★★★★★</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">29금 사주</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">관계나 끌림 같은 거까지 말해주니까 막혀 있던 고민이 풀렸어요. 친구한테도 추천했어요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400/90 text-xs">★★★★☆</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">연애사주</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">이성 끌림이나 호환되는 성격 설명이 잘 맞았음. 부담 없이 볼 수 있어서 좋았어요.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/saju/reviews" class="mt-4 block rounded-xl border border-dashed border-white/10 text-zinc-500 text-center py-3.5 text-sm hover:border-rose-500/30 hover:text-rose-300/80 transition-colors">
        후기 전체 보기
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 문의 ================= -->
    <section class="w-full px-4 pb-16">
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs mb-2">서비스 문의</p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/saju_jeonggam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm text-rose-300/90 hover:text-rose-300 transition-colors">공식 인스타그램 DM</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= 하단 ================= -->
    <section class="flex-1 px-8 pb-24">
      <p class="text-center text-zinc-600 text-sm">연애에 집중한, 기운소.</p>
    </section>

    <%- include('./../common/footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
